#let chapters = (
  (id: "setup", en: "Setup, themes and print mode", fr: "Installation, thèmes et mode impression", intro-en: "Everything starts with `faboxyst`, the show rule that installs a *theme*: a dictionary of colours, fonts, sketchiness, spacing and direction that every box reads. This chapter lists the setup functions, the ready-made themes and the print helpers.", intro-fr: "Tout commence par `faboxyst`, la règle `show` qui installe un *thème* : un dictionnaire de couleurs, polices, « nervosité » du trait, espacements et direction que lit chaque boîte. Ce chapitre décrit les fonctions de configuration, les thèmes prêts à l’emploi et les outils d’impression.", names: ("heading-weight","grayscale-paint","get-theme","is-print","make-theme","print-group","heading-weight"), values: ("palette","fonts","default-theme","themes","theme-state","counter-state","print-colours","felt")),
  (id: "fabox", en: "The main box: fabox, numbered and icon boxes", fr: "La boîte principale : fabox, boîtes numérotées et à icône", intro-en: "`fabox` is the all-purpose hand-drawn box: title bar, badge, tape, icon, shadow, hatching and answer line are all options. `numbox`, `iconbox` and the card helpers build on the same engine.", intro-fr: "`fabox` est la boîte manuscrite à tout faire : barre de titre, pastille, ruban adhésif, icône, ombre, hachures et ligne de réponse sont autant d’options. `numbox`, `iconbox` et les cartes reposent sur le même moteur.", names: ("fabox","fabox-sign","fabox-note","example-header","is-rtl","numbox","numbox-reset","iconbox","tip-card","concept-card","ico-star","ico-bulb","ico-pencil"), values: ("numbox-counter",)),
  (id: "blocks", en: "Semantic blocks, shapes and inline marks", fr: "Blocs sémantiques, formes et marqueurs en ligne", intro-en: "Short, expressive blocks for teaching documents (`note`, `tip`, `warning`, `example`, `definition`…) and general shapes (`sketch-box`, `plaque`, `block3d`, `hatched`…), followed by inline highlighters (`hl`, `mark`, `highlight-text`).", intro-fr: "Blocs courts et expressifs pour les documents pédagogiques (`note`, `tip`, `warning`, `example`, `definition`…) et formes générales (`sketch-box`, `plaque`, `block3d`, `hatched`…), puis surligneurs en ligne (`hl`, `mark`, `highlight-text`).", names: ("sketch-box","highlight","def-card","sticky","relief","insetbox","faboxyst","tip","warning","example","definition","block3d","hatched","plaque","double-frame","pill-box","mark","hl","mark-emph","highlight-formula","highlight-text"), values: ("MARKS",)),
  (id: "paper", en: "Paper, notebook and desk", fr: "Papier, cahier et bureau", intro-en: "Objects of a desk: post-its, ruled notebook paper, scrapbook pieces (tape, pins, clips, hearts), tickets, folders, spiral binding and neon signs. All of them are drawn, not images.", intro-fr: "Les objets d’un bureau : post-it, papier de cahier réglé, pièces de scrapbook (ruban, punaises, pinces, cœurs), tickets, chemises, reliure spirale et enseignes néon. Tout est dessiné, aucune image.", names: ("postit","postit-butterfly","garnet-box","numbered-header-box","notebook-box","sloppy-box","post-it","vignette","spread-box","ticket","folder","terminal","neon","polaroid","flag-ribbon","speed-bar","banner-3d","spiral-binding","bound-page","sb-heart","sb-tape","sb-pin","sb-clip","torn-note","ruled-sheet","stamp-card","grid-note","index-card","deckle-tag","notepad","lesson-card","lesson-table","sb-underline","sb-divider","taped-curl-note","paper-note-box"), values: ("sb-colours","sb-inks")),
  (id: "craft", en: "Plates and craft boxes", fr: "Plaques et boîtes artisanales", intro-en: "Boxes with a physical character: crests, ribbons, helices, tapes, boards, screws, planks, torn pages, spiral notebooks, gel buttons, stubs, file tabs, key tags, sashes and flags. The tape/plank/torn/coil families here replace the former page frames (see the migration note).", intro-fr: "Des boîtes à forte matérialité : écussons, rubans, hélices, adhésifs, tableaux, vis, planches, pages déchirées, cahiers à spirale, boutons gel, talons, onglets, étiquettes, bandeaux et fanions. Les familles ruban/planche/page déchirée/spirale remplacent ici les anciens cadres de page (voir la note de migration).", names: ("crestbox","ribbonbox","helixbox","swooshbox","circuitbox","keybox","ringbox","punchbox","plannerbox","filebox","stubbox","stackbox","calloutbox","tapebox","boardbox","plankbox","tornpage","coilbox","gelbox","screwbox","sashbox","flagbox","speech-bubble","joined-bubbles","five-w"), values: ("bb-colours","plank-colours","coil-colours")),
  (id: "frames", en: "Ornate frames, lace and ornaments", fr: "Cadres ornés, guillochis et ornements", intro-en: "Decorative frames for boxes: ogee banners, volute and rosette frames, parchment letters, vintage plates, guilloché lace, TikZ-style ornaments and the ornament API (`ornament`, `motifs`, `tint`) used to turn any motif into a coloured glyph.", intro-fr: "Cadres décoratifs pour les boîtes : bannières en ogive, cadres à volutes et rosettes, lettres sur parchemin, plaques vintage, guillochis, ornements de type TikZ et API d’ornements (`ornament`, `motifs`, `tint`) qui transforme tout motif en glyphe coloré.", names: ("lace","lacebox","pgfornament","ogeebox","frisebox","medallion","rosette","girih","volutebox","spiral-pts","ink-pts","parchemin","halftone","tikzpattern","vintageframe","vintagebox","rosettebox","ornament","make-palette","glyph-motif","content-motif","image-motif","tint","turned","ornatebox","khatambox","zellijbox","arabesquebox","mihrabbox","mosaicbox","fleuronbox","khatam-badge","sash-shape"), values: ("ogee-colours","volute-colours","flourish","scroll-colours","rosette-ink","rosette-gold","rosette-leaf","motifs","default-palette")),
  (id: "antique", en: "Engraving: the antique register", fr: "Gravure : le registre antique", intro-en: "Copperplate-style output built on nibart: engraved rules, frames, captions, plates and patents. Strokes are real nibart pen strokes (broad-nib contrast), not simulated wobble.", intro-fr: "Rendus de type taille-douce construits sur nibart : filets, cadres, légendes, planches et brevets gravés. Les traits sont de vrais traits de plume nibart (contraste de plume large), pas un tremblement simulé.", names: ("nib-pen","nib-stroke","nib-polylines","nib-line-path","nib-rect-path","polyline-path","nib-envelope","nib-curve","vintage-pts","vintage-outline","engraved","engraved-rule","engraved-frame","plate-page","patent-page","figure-caption","antique-label","antique-notes","antique-note"), values: ("antique-palette","antique-fonts")),
  (id: "programme", en: "Programme, meters, pictograms and covers", fr: "Programme, jauges, pictogrammes et couvertures", intro-en: "Teaching-programme components (lesson, pin, brush, subject cartouche), meters and pictograms (difficulty, gauge, chrono), watermarks and book covers.", intro-fr: "Composants de programme pédagogique (leçon, épingle, pinceau, cartouche de matière), jauges et pictogrammes (difficulté, jauge, chrono), filigranes et couvertures de livre.", names: ("leconbox","lecon-reset","pinbox","brushbox","matierebox","arc-pts","poly-pts","round-poly","meter","difficulty","pictochrono","tkzpicto","competence-crayon","level-counter","pictocible","bicolor-title","bicolor-bignum","banner-tri","banner-tri-bis","highway-sign","sale-poster","smooth-pts","book-cover","with-watermark","paint-watermark"), values: ("lecon-counter","prog-colours")),
  (id: "cards", en: "Slide components I — cards, lists and grids", fr: "Composants de diapositive I — cartes, listes et grilles", intro-en: "Ready-made information layouts: card grids, capsule lists, calendars, neumorphic panels and feature cards. Most take a `steps:` array of `(title:, body:, icon:)` dictionaries and a `width`.", intro-fr: "Mises en page d’information toutes faites : grilles de cartes, listes en capsules, calendriers, panneaux neumorphiques et cartes de fonctionnalités. La plupart prennent un tableau `steps:` de dictionnaires `(title:, body:, icon:)` et une `width`.", names: ("abstract-textbox","calendar-list","capsule-text-boxes","cards-with-corner-sleeve","cornered-cards","cube-block-list","double-duo-neumorphic","four-feature-icon-cards","l-shaped-header-box","frame-accent-block","half-framed-text-box","kinds-text-box-1","kinds-text-box-2","kinds-text-box-3","three-color-infographic-card","modern-block-list-box","nested-file-text-box","information-block-box","simple-rounded-text-box","two-column-information-card","card-list-box","stacked-summary-card-box","text-box-display-card","interlocked-abstract-textbox","feature-callout-box","wavy-infographic-box","neumorphic-diamond-box","neumorphic-text-panel","six-boxes-template-box","six-boxes-outline-box","six-boxes-tilted-box","six-boxes-banded-box","six-boxes-pointer-card","three-color-infographic-stack"), values: ()),
